ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Los insectos, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}como otras cosas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
cuanto más grandes, más peligro
tienen, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Böceklerde de, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}çoğu şeyde olduğu gibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
büyük olan her zaman daha iyi değildir,
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Les insectes, c'est comme les gens.
Il vaut mieux garder ses distances,
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}sinon tu te fais bouffer.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

J'aimerais bien savoir ce qui se
passe dans la tête d'un insecte...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bah, sûrement pas grand-chose,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
comme chez nous !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}You know, being a guy doesn't mean
you're automatically not afraid of
bugs, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}right?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I mean,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} of course I'm OK with bugs.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'm just saying is all...

FR:
Tu sais, il y a beaucoup d'hommes
qui ont peur des insectes. Bien plus
qu'on ne le pense...
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non, je parle pas de moi !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Enfin...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
euh... {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Et toi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}} Moi non plus !{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}(Pfiou, ça aurait été la honte...){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

IT:
Sembra che avere paura degli insetti
sia roba da femmine...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ma chi l'ha detto?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Intendiamoci:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} a me gli insetti
non fanno paura.
Era giusto così, per dire...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Erkek olmak otomatik olarak böceklerden
korkmamak demek değil, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}tamam mı?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} tabii ki benim böceklerle sorunum yok.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sadece söylüyorum...
